<title>SWITZERLAND: UBS insists has under one pct of DePfa.</title>
<headline>UBS insists has under one pct of DePfa.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland (UBS) denied renewed claims that it held a nine percent stake in German mortgage lender DePfa-Bank AG.</p>
<p>&quot;I have nothing to add to my statement this morning. UBS has substantially less than one percent,&quot; spokesman Franz Raggenbass said about equity in DePfa.</p>
<p>Raggenbass was responding to a statement repeated by DePfa that UBS had amassed nine percent of its shares, which the Swiss bank earlier denied. UBS also said on Tuesday it had no interest in acquiring the smaller German bank.</p>
</text>
